(v) (A) the letter agreement re: Base Call Option Transaction, dated as of October 1, 2014, between the Company and Wells Fargo Securities, LLC and (B) the letter agreement re: Additional Call Option Transaction, dated as of October 2, 2014, between the Company and Wells Fargo Securities, LLC; where each such transaction shall be a “Call Option”;","cross_reference_target":null,"owner_hint":null},{"section_reference":"8.03","defined_term":"Commonly Controlled Entity","definition_kind":"TERM_DEFINITION","definition_head_quote":"“Commonly Controlled Entity” means","definition_body_quote":"any person or entity that, together with the Company, is treated as a single employer under Section 414(b), (c), (m) or (o) of the Code or with respect to which the Company is otherwise jointly or severally liable under applicable Law;","cross_reference_target":"Section 414(b), (c), (m) or (o) of the Code","owner_hint":null},{"section_reference":"8.03","defined_term":"Company Personnel","definition_kind":"TERM_DEFINITION","definition_head_quote":"“Company Personnel” means","definition_body_quote":"any current or former director, officer, employee, contractor or consultant of the Company or any of its Subsidiaries;","cross_reference_target":null,"owner_hint":null},{"section_reference":"8.03","defined_term":"Contract","definition_kind":"TERM_DEFINITION","definition_head_quote":"“Contract” means","definition_body_quote":"any loan or credit agreement, bond, debenture, note, mortgage, indenture, guarantee, lease or other contract, commitment, agreement, instrument, arrangement, understanding, obligation, undertaking or license, whether oral or written.","cross_reference_target":null,"owner_hint":null},{"section_reference":"8.03","defined_term":"Convertible Notes","definition_kind":"TERM_DEFINITION","definition_head_quote":"“Convertible Notes” means","definition_body_quote":"the 0.25% convertible senior notes due 2019 issued pursuant to the Notes Indenture;","cross_reference_target":null,"owner_hint":null},{"section_reference":"8.03","defined_term":"Indebtedness","definition_kind":"TERM_DEFINITION","definition_head_quote":"“Indebtedness” means","definition_body_quote":"any (A) indebtedness for borrowed money, (B) indebtedness evidenced by any bond, debenture, note, mortgage, indenture or other debt instrument or debt security, (C) accounts payable to trade creditors and accrued expenses not arising in the ordinary course of business, (D) capital lease obligations, (E) liabilities arising out of interest rate and currency swap arrangements and any other arrangements designed to provide protection against fluctuations in interest or currency rates, (F) liabilities under sale-and-leaseback transactions, agreements to repurchase securities sold and other similar financing transactions, (G) liabilities arising from any breach of any of the foregoing or (H) guarantees with respect to any indebtedness or obligation of a type described in clauses (A) through (G) above of any other person (other than, in the case of clauses (A) and (B), accounts payable to trade creditors and accrued expenses, in each case arising in the ordinary course of business);","cross_reference_target":null,"owner_hint":null},{"section_reference":"8.03","defined_term":"person","definition_kind":"TERM_DEFINITION","definition_head_quote":"“person” means","definition_body_quote":"any natural person, corporation, limited liability company, partnership, joint venture, trust, business association, Governmental Entity or other entity;","cross_reference_target":null,"owner_hint":null},{"section_reference":"8.03","defined_term":"Subsidiary","definition_kind":"TERM_DEFINITION","definition_head_quote":"a “Subsidiary” of any person means","definition_body_quote":"any other person (i) more than 50% of whose outstanding shares or securities representing the right to vote for the election of directors or other managing authority of such other person are, now or hereafter, owned or controlled, directly or indirectly, by such first person, but such other person shall be deemed to be a Subsidiary only so long as such ownership or control exists, or (ii) which does not have outstanding shares or securities with such right to vote, as may be the case in a partnership, joint venture or unincorporated association, but more than 50% of whose ownership interest representing the right to make the decisions for such other person is, now or hereafter, owned or controlled, directly or indirectly, by such first person, but such other person shall be deemed to be a Subsidiary only so long as such ownership or control exists;","cross_reference_target":null,"owner_hint":null},{"section_reference":"8.03","defined_term":"Warrants","definition_kind":"TERM_DEFINITION","definition_head_quote":"“Warrants” means","definition_body_quote":"the warrant transactions evidenced by:
